<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Privacy Policy — Dave's Vet Station</title>
<style>
  :root{--afblue:#00308F;--ink:#0A1428;--paper:#F5F7FB;--muted:#5B6B85;--line:#D4DEEE;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;font-family:"Helvetica Neue",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);line-height:1.65}
  .wrap{width:min(760px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:0 auto;padding:40px 0 80px}
  .back{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--afblue);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:24px}
  .cross{display:inline-block;position:relative;width:26px;height:26px;background:var(--afblue);border-radius:22%;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px}
  .cross::before,.cross::after{content:"";position:absolute;background:#fff;border-radius:2px}
  .cross::before{left:50%;top:22%;width:18%;height:56%;transform:translateX(-50%)}
  .cross::after{top:50%;left:22%;height:18%;width:56%;transform:translateY(-50%)}
  h1{font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 4px}
  .updated{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin:0 0 32px}
  h2{font-size:1.2rem;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:34px 0 10px;color:var(--afblue)}
  p,li{color:var(--ink);font-size:1rem}
  .callout{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--afblue);border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0}
  a{color:var(--afblue)}
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:50px;padding-top:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <a class="back" href="./index.html">← Dave's Vet Station</a>
  <h1><span class="cross"></span>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: July 26, 2026</p>

  <div class="callout">
    <strong>The short version:</strong> We collect the information you give us
    (like questions you ask and details about your animals) to make the Service
    work and improve it. We don't sell your personal information. Payment details
    are handled by our payment processor, not stored by us.
  </div>

  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Dave's Vet Station, operated by Sagewire
  Syndicate ("we," "us," "our"), collects, uses, and protects your information
  when you use our Service. By using the Service, you agree to this Policy.</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p><strong>Information you provide:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Questions, descriptions, and photos you submit to the AI assistants;</li>
    <li>Information about your animals (such as name, species, breed, age,
    weight, and health details) if you choose to save records;</li>
    <li>Account information (such as name and email) if you create an account;</li>
    <li>Communications you send to us.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Basic technical data such as device type, browser, and general usage
    (for example, which features are used), to keep the Service working and
    improve it.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Payment information:</strong> If you make a purchase, payment is
  processed by a third-party payment provider. We do not store your full card
  details; we may receive limited information such as confirmation of payment and
  the last four digits of a card.</p>

  <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To provide the Service and generate responses to your questions;</li>
    <li>To remember your animals' records so the assistants can give you more
    relevant help over time;</li>
    <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the Service;</li>
    <li>To process payments and manage accounts;</li>
    <li>To communicate with you about the Service;</li>
    <li>To comply with legal obligations and protect the safety and rights of
    users.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. AI Processing</h2>
  <p>To generate responses, your questions and relevant context may be processed
  by third-party AI providers that power the assistants. These providers process
  the information to return a response and are expected to handle it in
  accordance with their own terms. Please avoid submitting sensitive personal
  information you would not want processed this way.</p>

  <h2>4. How We Share Information</h2>
  <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information. We may share
  information with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Service providers</strong> who help us operate the Service (such
    as hosting, AI processing, and payment processing), only as needed to perform
    their functions;</li>
    <li><strong>Legal authorities</strong> if required by law or to protect
    rights, safety, or property;</li>
    <li><strong>A successor</strong> in the event of a merger, acquisition, or
    sale of assets.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Your Records &amp; Other Users</h2>
  <p>If you save records about your animals, those records are associated with
  your account or household and are intended to be accessible only in connection
  with your use of the Service. We take reasonable steps so that customers access
  their own records and not those of others.</p>

  <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We keep information for as long as needed to provide the Service and for
  legitimate business or legal purposes. You may request deletion of your account
  information by contacting us (see below).</p>

  <h2>7. Security</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable measures to protect your information. However, no method
  of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee
  absolute security.</p>

  <h2>8. Children</h2>
  <p>The Service is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly
  collect personal information from them.</p>

  <h2>9. Your Choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You can choose not to provide certain information, though some features
    may not work without it.</li>
    <li>You can request access to or deletion of your account information by
    contacting us.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Policy from time to time. We will update the "Last
  updated" date above when we do. Continued use of the Service after changes take
  effect constitutes acceptance of the updated Policy.</p>

  <h2>11. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this Policy or your information? Contact us at
  <a href="mailto:hello@davesvetstation.com">hello@davesvetstation.com</a>.</p>

  <footer>
    Dave's Vet Station is operated by Sagewire Syndicate. This page is provided
    for general informational purposes and does not constitute legal advice.
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
